<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"/>
<title>Before You Leave – Shokher Corner</title>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cormorant+Garamond:ital,wght@0,400;0,600;1,400&family=Lato:wght@300;400&family=Dancing+Script:wght@600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet"/>
<style>
*{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box;}
:root{--burgundy:#4A1729;--wine:#2D101D;--ivory:#F8F1E8;--cream:#EFE3D5;--rose:#C58F98;--blush:#E8C7CA;--gold:#C5A16D;}
body{font-family:'Lato',sans-serif;background:var(--wine);color:var(--ivory);overflow-x:hidden;min-height:100vh;}
h1,h2{font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;}
nav{position:sticky;top:0;z-index:100;background:rgba(45,16,29,0.95);backdrop-filter:blur(10px);border-bottom:1px solid rgba(197,161,109,0.2);}
.nav-inner{max-width:1200px;margin:auto;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:1rem 1.5rem;}
.nav-brand{font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;font-size:1.5rem;color:var(--gold);text-decoration:none;}
.nav-links{display:flex;gap:1.2rem;list-style:none;}
.nav-links a{text-decoration:none;color:rgba(248,241,232,.6);font-size:.82rem;transition:color .3s;}
.nav-links a:hover{color:var(--gold);}
.hamburger{display:none;flex-direction:column;gap:5px;cursor:pointer;background:none;border:none;padding:4px;}
.hamburger span{display:block;width:24px;height:2px;background:var(--gold);}
.mobile-nav{display:none;flex-direction:column;background:var(--wine);border-top:1px solid rgba(197,161,109,.2);}
.mobile-nav a{padding:.8rem 1.5rem;text-decoration:none;color:var(--blush);border-bottom:1px solid rgba(197,161,109,.1);}
.mobile-nav.open{display:flex;}
@media(max-width:768px){.nav-links{display:none;}.hamburger{display:flex;}}
.final-hero{position:relative;min-height:100vh;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;overflow:hidden;}
.final-bg{position:absolute;inset:0;background-image:url('public/assets/images/hero/hero-final.jpg');background-size:cover;background-position:center;}
.final-overlay{position:absolute;inset:0;background:linear-gradient(to bottom,rgba(45,16,29,.8),rgba(29,10,20,.95));}
.final-content{position:relative;text-align:center;padding:3rem 2rem;max-width:720px;animation:fadeUp 1.5s ease forwards;opacity:0;}
@keyframes fadeUp{to{opacity:1;transform:translateY(0);}from{opacity:0;transform:translateY(30px);}}
.final-label{font-size:.75rem;letter-spacing:4px;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--gold);margin-bottom:1.5rem;}
.final-title{font-size:clamp(2.5rem,6vw,4rem);color:var(--ivory);margin-bottom:1rem;}
.final-sub{color:var(--blush);font-style:italic;margin-bottom:3rem;font-size:1.1rem;}
.final-letter{font-size:.95rem;line-height:2.1;color:rgba(248,241,232,.8);max-width:600px;margin:0 auto 2.5rem;text-align:left;white-space:pre-line;}
.final-closing{font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;font-size:2rem;color:var(--gold);font-style:italic;margin-bottom:2.5rem;}
.btn-home{display:inline-block;background:var(--gold);color:var(--wine);padding:.9rem 2.5rem;text-decoration:none;font-size:.85rem;letter-spacing:3px;text-transform:uppercase;transition:.4s;}
.btn-home:hover{background:var(--ivory);}
footer{background:rgba(0,0,0,.4);color:rgba(248,241,232,.3);text-align:center;padding:2rem;font-size:.8rem;}
footer a{color:var(--gold);text-decoration:none;}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<nav>
  <div class="nav-inner">
    <a href="index.html" class="nav-brand">Shokher Corner</a>
    <ul class="nav-links">
      <li><a href="our-story.html">Our Story</a></li><li><a href="shokher-corner.html">Shokher Corner</a></li>
      <li><a href="memory-vault.html">Memory Vault</a></li><li><a href="letters.html">Letters</a></li>
      <li><a href="open-when.html">Open When</a></li><li><a href="little-things.html">Little Things</a></li>
      <li><a href="our-universe.html">Our Universe</a></li><li><a href="someday.html">Someday</a></li>
      <li><a href="soundtrack.html">Soundtrack</a></li><li><a href="reasons.html">Reasons</a></li>
      <li><a href="secret-room.html">✦ Secret</a></li>
    </ul>
    <button class="hamburger" id="hamburger"><span></span><span></span><span></span></button>
  </div>
  <div class="mobile-nav" id="mobileNav">
    <a href="index.html">Home</a><a href="our-story.html">Our Story</a><a href="shokher-corner.html">Shokher Corner</a>
    <a href="memory-vault.html">Memory Vault</a><a href="letters.html">Letters</a><a href="open-when.html">Open When</a>
    <a href="little-things.html">Little Things</a><a href="our-universe.html">Our Universe</a>
    <a href="someday.html">Someday</a><a href="soundtrack.html">Soundtrack</a><a href="reasons.html">Reasons</a>
    <a href="secret-room.html">✦ Secret Room</a>
  </div>
</nav>
<section class="final-hero">
  <div class="final-bg"></div>
  <div class="final-overlay"></div>
  <div class="final-content">
    <p class="final-label">The last page</p>
    <h1 class="final-title">Before You Leave...</h1>
    <p class="final-sub">One last little thing.</p>
    <p class="final-letter">If you have reached this page, you have explored a little world I made for you.

Every photograph, every little wish, every letter, and every memory has a reason to be here.

I hope that whenever you visit this place, you remember that the little things about you are never little to me.

Thank you for being part of my favourite memories.

And there are still so many more to make.</p>
    <p class="final-closing">"Our story is still being written."</p>
    <a href="index.html" class="btn-home">Back to the Beginning</a>
  </div>
</section>
<footer><p><a href="index.html">← Back to Home</a> &nbsp;·&nbsp; Shokher Corner &nbsp;·&nbsp; Made with love, just for you.</p></footer>
<script>document.getElementById('hamburger').addEventListener('click',()=>document.getElementById('mobileNav').classList.toggle('open'));</script>
</body>
</html>
